**Run it:** Open the Apps Script editor from Extensions > Apps Script, paste this, save, and run `cleanSurvey` from the active survey sheet. Grant permissions on first run.

**Notes:**
- The phone (H) and park-key (J) formulas match the versions we settled on. The timestamp formula is slightly changed: date-only text no longer returns REVIEW, because the time part defaults to 0 when it can't be parsed. Revert that line if you want strict handling.
- The script rebuilds formulas for exactly the rows present (`getLastRow()`), so row counts can grow or shrink between runs. Helper columns G:P are cleared before rewriting.
- ParkMap is only created if missing. If you already have it, existing entries stay as they are. Its keys must be the output of the park-key expression, for example `westside`, not `West Side`.
- Columns A:F are never touched.

