**What changed:**
1. **Freeze:** Row 1 is frozen on the active sheet and on ParkMap.
2. **Protection:** G:P (all rows) is protected with the description "Helper cols G:P". Editors are limited to the owner. The script removes any previous protection with that description before rewriting, so re-runs don't stack protections.

