 * Cleans the active survey sheet and auto-codes open-ended responses into themes.
 *
 * cleanSurvey(): writes helper formulas to G:P (headers in row 1, data from row 2),
 * freezes the header row, protects G2:<end col><lastRow> (headers stay editable), creates
 * ParkMap if missing, then runs the theme coder on the active sheet if it has at
 * least one non-empty response. The coder uses the current selection on that sheet
 * when there is one, and otherwise rows 2..lastRow. It respects CONFIG.forceOverwrite.
 *
